### 7.3 API Authentication Flow

```
1. Client → POST /api/v1/auth/verify-otp
   Response: { access_token, refresh_token, device_id }

2. Client attaches: Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

3. API Gateway validates JWT (RS256, public key from JWKS endpoint)

4. On 401: Client → POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
   Body: { refresh_token }
   Response: { new_access_token, new_refresh_token }
```

