## 21. Risk Analysis

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|-------------|--------|-----------|
| E2E Encryption complexity | High | High | Use proven Signal Protocol library |
| WebRTC group call scale | Medium | High | SFU (mediasoup) + horizontal scale |
| MySQL at chat scale | Medium | High | Sharding + read replicas + Redis cache |
| Firebase OTP cost | Low | Medium | Monitor usage, implement rate limits |
| Security breach | Low | Critical | Zero-trust + regular pen testing |
| Regulatory compliance | Medium | High | Legal counsel + GDPR-first design |
| Team velocity | Medium | Medium | Phased roadmap + feature flags |
| Storage costs | Low | Medium | Tiered storage + media expiry |

